    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Smith Harrington, one of Ireland's longest-established estate agents, are delighted to present 40 Willow Close, a beautifully maintained, fully furnished three-bedroom semi-detached home ideally positioned on a end site in a cul-de-sac at the front of the populare development The Willows, Dunshaughlin, Co. Meath.\r\n\r\nBuilt in 2018 and extending to approximately 114 sq. m. (1,227 sq. ft.), this impressive A3-rated home combines contemporary design, generous living space and excellent energy efficiency—perfect for modern family living.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation is bright, spacious and exceptionally well laid out. A welcoming entrance hall leads to a guest WC, a generous sitting room, and a superb open-plan kitchen cum dining area that forms the heart of the home. Featuring a large central island and double doors opening onto the good-sized rear garden. The seamless connection between the indoor and outdoor spaces makes this an ideal home for entertaining and family living alike. A separate utility room completes the ground floor.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, there are three spacious bedrooms, all with built-in wardrobes, including a master bedroom with en-suite, together with a stylish family bathroom.\r\nThe property boasts an excellent A3 BER, solar panels and gas-fired central heating, delivering outstanding comfort and lower energy costs.\r\n\r\nOutside, the home enjoys a prime end-site position with a cobble lock driveway providing ample off-street parking, bordered by lawn on one side and low-maintenance gravel area to the other. A gated side entrance provides access to the good sized, fully walled rear garden with extensive patio area ideal for outdoor dining and family enjoyment, low-maintenance kerbed bed to one side with hedging, garden shed, outside tap and external power socket. \r\n\r\n40 Willow Close is superbly situated within walking distance of Dunshaughlin and its excellent range of amenities. Residents can enjoy popular cafés and restaurants including Bruges, Costa Coffee and Gourmet Food Parlour, alongside Aldi, Lidl, Supervalu, local boutiques, schools and a wide variety of sporting and recreational facilities.\r\n\r\nDunshaughlin is one of Co. Meath's most desirable commuter towns, with regular bus services to Dublin City Centre and immediate access to the M3 motorway, providing excellent connectivity to the M50 and Dublin Airport. Ashbourne and Blanchardstown are also just a short drive away.\r\n\r\nThis is a superb opportunity to acquire a turnkey, energy-efficient family home in one of Dunshaughlin's most desirable residential developments."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Accommodation\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall  1.10m x 6.65m + 0.90m x 1.19m + 1.61m x 0.57m\r\nGuest WC  1.50m x 1.45m\r\nSitting Room  3.80m x 4.05m + 0.79m x 2.87m\r\nKitchen cum Dining Room  5.01m x 5.24m\r\nUtility Room  0.73m x 1.67m + 1.61m x 1.44m \r\nLanding  1.30m x 2.57m\r\nMaster Bedroom  4.10m x 3.02m + 0.58m x 2.69m\r\nEn-Suite\t1.09m x 2.68m\r\nBedroom 2  2.79m x 4.32m\r\nBedroom 3  2.11m x 3.08m + 1.40m x 0.74m\r\nBathroom  1.70m x 1.28m + 1.23m x 0.99m\r\n\r\nServices  \r\nNatural gas central heating,\t Solar panels installed.\tMains water. \tMains sewerage. \r\n\r\nFixtures & Fittings                                                                                                                                 \r\nProperty being sold as seen with all appliances and furniture included in sale. \r\n\r\nBER Details\r\nBER: A3,\tBER No. 110353190,\tPerformance Indicator 53.13 kWh/m²/yr.\r\n\r\nTitle \r\nFreehold."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "- Fully furnished, A3 rated, 3-bedroom semi-detached family home.\r\n- Bright, spacious accommodation in turnkey condition ready for immediate occupation.\r\n- End-site position in cul-de-sac with ample parking, fully walled rear garden with extensive patio.\r\n- Located towards the front of the highly sought-after Willows development.\r\n- Walking distance to Dunshaughlin village and all amenities.\r\n- Excellent access to M3, M50, Dublin City Centre and Dublin Airport with regular bus routes to Dublin.\r\n- Solar panels installed, reducing running costs.\r\n- Spacious open-plan kitchen cum dining area with feature island.\r\n- Three generous bedrooms all with built-in wardrobes, master with en-suite.\r\n- Built circa 2018. Fully alarmed."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: A3"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Directions",
        "SortOrder": 5,
        "Content": "Enter Eircode A85 Y049 into Google Maps for precise directions to the property.\r\nNo. 40 will be identified by our “For Sale” sign."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Viewing Details",
        "SortOrder": 6,
        "Content": "Viewing strictly by appointment only. \r\nAll viewings by sole selling agents Smith Harrington Chartered Surveyors. \r\nTel: 046 9021113 Email info@smithharrington.ie - 8/9 Bridge Street, Navan, Co Meath C15 F386.\r\n\r\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs/floors provided for guidance only."
      }
